<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="1971812333"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1639574241"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="海底列車"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="PIKASONIC / なこたんまる"/><amll:meta key="album" value="海底列車"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="03:55.768"><div begin="00:00.136" end="03:55.768"><p begin="00:00.136" end="00:04.957" itunes:key="L1">酷い雨は痛くて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">猛烈的大雨砸得人生疼</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka i te i re 's sha - PIKASONIC/ nakotanmaru</span></p><p begin="00:04.958" end="00:12.895" itunes:key="L2">水たまりが僕らを呑んでいく<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">水洼将我们吞没</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mi zu ta ma ri ga bo ku ra wo no n de i ku</span></p><p begin="00:12.896" end="00:18.824" itunes:key="L3">言葉の針は痛くて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">言语的针头刺得人生疼</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko to ba no ha ri ha i ta ku te</span></p><p begin="00:18.825" end="00:34.078" itunes:key="L4">自由に僕らを傷つける<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">自由地伤害着我们</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ji yu u ni bo ku ra wo ki zu tsu ke ru</span></p><p begin="00:34.079" end="00:37.642" itunes:key="L5">そんな世界で、せめて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在那样的世界 至少</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so n na se ka i de se me te</span></p><p begin="00:38.076" end="00:44.200" itunes:key="L6">君を笑う声が聞こえないように<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">希望能听不见嘲笑你的声音</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki mi wo wa ra u ko e ga ki ko e na i yo u ni</span></p><p begin="00:44.201" end="00:49.621" itunes:key="L7">僕は今日も歌うよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我今天也会歌唱</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">bo ku ha kyo u mo u ta u yo</span></p><p begin="00:49.622" end="00:55.047" itunes:key="L8">もう何も聞きたくないからって<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为什么也不愿再去听了</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mo u na ni mo ki ki ta ku na i ka ra 't te</span></p><p begin="00:55.048" end="00:58.473" itunes:key="L9">悲しみの海に沈む<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">于是沉入悲伤的海里</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka na shi mi no u mi ni shi zu mu</span></p><p begin="00:58.474" end="01:02.365" itunes:key="L10">君を見ていたんだ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">看见了你</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki mi wo mi te i ta n da</span></p><p begin="01:14.449" end="01:20.472" itunes:key="L11">こんな騒々しい場所じゃ僕の<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在这样喧嚣的地方</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko n na so u zo u shi i ba sho ja bo ku no</span></p><p begin="01:20.473" end="01:26.597" itunes:key="L12">声さえ曖昧になる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我的声音也变得模糊不清</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko e sa e a i ma i ni na ru</span></p><p begin="01:26.598" end="01:29.422" itunes:key="L13">あの夏君を待っていた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那个夏天 我等待着你</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a no na tsu ki mi wo ma 't te i ta</span></p><p begin="01:29.423" end="01:34.224" itunes:key="L14">その時の温度ずっと覚えているから<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那个时候的温度</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so no to ki no o n do</span></p><p begin="01:34.225" end="01:39.503" itunes:key="L15">もう大丈夫だよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">所以没关系哦</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mo u da i jo u bu da yo</span></p><p begin="01:50.983" end="01:54.449" itunes:key="L16">酸素も重力も関係ないよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无关乎氧气也无关乎重力</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">sa n so mo ju u ryo ku mo ka n ke i na i yo</span></p><p begin="01:54.450" end="01:59.772" itunes:key="L17">今は2人の息の音と<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如今只能听见</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i ma ha fu ta ri no i ki no o to to</span></p><p begin="01:59.773" end="02:15.722" itunes:key="L18">海の音だけ聞いてようよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们的呼吸与海浪的声音</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">u mi no o to da ke ki i te yo u yo</span></p><p begin="02:28.739" end="02:34.856" itunes:key="L19">僕がとびきりの笑顔をしても<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">虽然就算我笑得再开心</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">bo ku ga to bi ki ri no e ga o wo shi te mo</span></p><p begin="02:34.857" end="02:40.424" itunes:key="L20">世界の悲しみはなくならないけど<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">也无法消除世界的悲伤</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">se ka i no ka na shi mi ha na ku na ra na i ke do</span></p><p begin="02:40.425" end="02:45.747" itunes:key="L21">この空を見上げればいつだって<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">可是只要抬头仰望这片天空</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko no so ra wo mi a ge re ba i tsu da 't te</span></p><p begin="02:45.748" end="02:53.468" itunes:key="L22">あの頃の一等星が僕らを照らすんだ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那时最亮的星星</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a no ko ro no i 't to u se i ga</span></p><p begin="03:05.656" end="03:11.839" itunes:key="L23">君が見たい世界を見られるように<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">希望能够看到你想见到的世界</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki mi ga mi ta i se ka i wo mi ra re ru yo u ni</span></p><p begin="03:11.840" end="03:17.264" itunes:key="L24">僕は今日も手を引くよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">今天我也会拉住你的手</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">bo ku ha kyo u mo te wo hi ku yo</span></p><p begin="03:17.265" end="03:21.056" itunes:key="L25">どこまでも沈んだって<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无论下沉到哪里</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">do ko ma de mo shi zu n da 't te</span></p><p begin="03:21.057" end="03:23.239" itunes:key="L26">底を走る僕を見て<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即使看见我在海底奔跑</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so ko wo ha shi ru bo ku wo mi te</span></p><p begin="03:23.240" end="03:26.484" itunes:key="L27">嘲笑う人がいたって<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">有人发出不屑嘲笑</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a za wa ra u hi to ga i ta 't te</span></p><p begin="03:26.485" end="03:55.768" itunes:key="L28">君と行きたいんだ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我也想和你一同前行</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki mi to i ki ta i n da</span></p></div></body></tt>